     1,
     "<div dir=\"ltr\">Is it possible to create vertical tabs in a Shiny app (instead of the default horizontal <a href=\"https://shiny.rstudio.com/reference/shiny/latest/tabsetPanel.html\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"nofollow\" data-saferedirecturl=\"https://www.google.com/url?hl=en-US&amp;q=https://shiny.rstudio.com/reference/shiny/latest/tabsetPanel.html&amp;source=gmail&amp;ust=1792390309854000&amp;usg=AOvVaw19dOAunhNDTzP4OS4-KNx2\">tabsetPanel</a> or <a href=\"https://shiny.rstudio.com/reference/shiny/latest/navlistPanel.html\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"nofollow\" data-saferedirecturl=\"https://www.google.com/url?hl=en-US&amp;q=https://shiny.rstudio.com/reference/shiny/latest/navlistPanel.html&amp;source=gmail&amp;ust=1792390309854000&amp;usg=AOvVaw0XsX7VHw1EqfXHi1mjMP4u\">navlistPanel</a>?<div><br></div><div>For example...</div><div><a href=\"http://mozmonkey.com/pages/examples/tabbox2/simple/vertical/index.html\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"nofollow\" data-saferedirecturl=\"https://www.google.com/url?hl=en-US&amp;q=http://mozmonkey.com/pages/examples/tabbox2/simple/vertical/index.html&amp;source=gmail&amp;ust=1792390309854000&amp;usg=AOvVaw0Ma4QeMucmOhXtGeUlmSkl\">http://mozmonkey.com/pages/examples/tabbox2/simple/vertical/index.html</a><br></div><div><br></div><p style=\"text-align:left;clear:both\"><a href=\"http://mozmonkey.com/pages/examples/tabbox2/simple/vertical/index.html\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"nofollow\" data-saferedirecturl=\"https://www.google.com/url?hl=en-US&amp;q=http://mozmonkey.com/pages/examples/tabbox2/simple/vertical/index.html&amp;source=gmail&amp;ust=1792390309854000&amp;usg=AOvVaw0Ma4QeMucmOhXtGeUlmSkl\"><img src=\"https://lh3.googleusercontent.com/-Tb23iFZB-eI/WOPCjqsHQTI/AAAAAAACBL4/NdQ5rqEbJqUiAeD7lH9EFVLxoNbgPiqwACLcB/s1600/2017-04-04%2B10-57-01%2B-%2BVertical%2BTabs.png\" border=\"0\" alt=\" Vertical Tabs Functional Sample\"></a></p><div><br></div></div>"
